            "pk": "17889743817421616",
            "text": "🎬 International Short Film Competition Using AI — “AI MOTION”\n\nWant to tell the story of Kazakhstan through creativity and artificial intelligence? 🌟\n\n Here’s your unique chance to create a short film and showcase your work to the world!\n\nCompetition Goals:\n ✨ Promote the cultural heritage of Northern Kazakhstan through digital content\n ✨ Present the region as modern, open, and innovative\n ✨ Encourage ecological awareness and integrate AI into creative processes\n\nThemes:\n 🎬 “Northern Kazakhstan — Region of Opportunities”\n 🎬 “Botai: Origins of the Steppe Civilization”\n 🎬 “Ecology and Sustainable Development in Kazakhstan”\n\nParticipation Requirements:\n ⏱ Film duration: 2–7.5 minutes\n 📹 Format: horizontal MP4\n 👥 Authors: individual participants or teams\n 📅 Competition period: February 2 – March 2, 2026\n 📥 Submission deadline: February 25, 2026\n💰 Prize fund: $1,500 ($500 per theme)\n 🏆 Winners will be selected by an expert jury and announced at online and offline award ceremonies\n\nThe competition is organized by the QYZYLJAR CREATIVE CENTER Creative Industries Center with the support of the Department of Culture, Language Development and Archives of the North Kazakhstan Region.\n\n📌 Apply, review the competition rules, and join the Telegram chat via the link in our profile!\n\nCreate Kazakhstan’s future through AI and animation — your idea could become a part of history! ✨"
